WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.449 --> 00:00:15.290
Cartographers used to include fake towns on
their maps to catch forgers.

00:00:15.290 --> 00:00:22.880
Sudan is the only country that still has crucifixion
as an official form of capital punishment.

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:28.970
Famous left-handed people include Napoleon,
Da Vinci, Michelangelo, Einstein, Newton,

00:00:28.970 --> 00:00:33.460
Bill Gates, Oprah, Obama and Jimi Hendrix.

00:00:33.460 --> 00:00:39.710
Honeybees always know where the Sun is, even
if it's on the other side of the world.

00:00:39.710 --> 00:00:45.870
You have a better chance of getting accepted
to Harvard University than getting a job at

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:47.790
an Apple Store.

00:00:47.790 --> 00:00:52.940
For some reason South Korean soap operas are
popular in Cuba.

00:00:52.940 --> 00:01:02.030
Crime, disease and average walking speed increase
by 15% as a city doubles in size.

00:01:02.030 --> 00:01:08.579
Within 200 yards of the flat in Islington
where George Orwell had the idea for 1984,

00:01:08.579 --> 00:01:13.189
there are now 32 CCTV cameras.

00:01:13.189 --> 00:01:18.290
Every living thing can be anaesthetised, even
plants.

00:01:18.290 --> 00:01:25.109
Despite their successful use since the mid-19th
century, no one really understands how anaesthetics

00:01:25.109 --> 00:01:26.609
work.

00:01:26.609 --> 00:01:32.119
India has a higher population than the entire
Western Hemisphere.

00:01:32.119 --> 00:01:37.850
Elephants have the longest pregnancy in the
animal kingdom at 22 months.

00:01:37.850 --> 00:01:43.039
The longest human pregnancy on record is 17
months, 11 days.

00:01:43.039 --> 00:01:49.819
In the U.S., meat is treated with carbon monoxide
to make it look fresh.

00:01:49.819 --> 00:01:52.859
India has a Bill of Rights for cows.

00:01:52.859 --> 00:02:04.950
In 1980, a Las Vegas hospital suspended workers
for betting on when patients would die.

